\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Overview of \textsc  {AdaTransolver}. Uniform random subsets with variable cardinality make one checkpoint usable across point budgets. At test time, a refinement policy reallocates the remaining spatial budget, while measure-aware point-to-slice aggregation keeps the target physical measure fixed. The model parameters remain frozen throughout both inference passes.}}{2}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:overview}{{1}{2}{Overview of \method . Uniform random subsets with variable cardinality make one checkpoint usable across point budgets. At test time, a refinement policy reallocates the remaining spatial budget, while measure-aware point-to-slice aggregation keeps the target physical measure fixed. The model parameters remain frozen throughout both inference passes}{figure.1}{}}
